        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/40c25aa20da991768fc65fab1486a996.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[World]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the late Joseon era, Western paintings became popular across the land. However, the creatures sealed inside these paintings began to awaken and attack nearby villages. Behind this chaos was <strong>Yuyahheukgun</strong>, a sorcerer from Qing China who sought to plunge Joseon into disorder and rule it by using the power of Western art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop him and protect the people, <strong>Jeon Woo-chi</strong>, the greatest Taoist sorcerer of Joseon, set out on his journey. But after being defeated by Yuyahheukgun’s overwhelming magic, he becomes trapped inside the world of the paintings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Taoist Arts]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeon Woo-chi uses various Taoist abilities—illusion magic, clone techniques, and instant-step movement—to defeat his enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusion:</strong> Casts an illusion on enemies, causing them to fight each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Clone Technique:</strong> Summons a clone identical to Jeon Woo-chi to assist in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Step:</strong> Dodges an enemy’s attack and instantly appears in front of them to strike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Action]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>parries</strong> and <strong>perfect dodges</strong> to defeat your foes and enjoy stylish execution moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[2D]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, Jeon Woo-chi can enter the world inside the painting and engage in <strong>2D side-scrolling combat</strong>. Seamlessly switch between <strong>2D and 3D</strong> for a unique and dynamic combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Content]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jeon Woo-chi explores a <strong>total of four maps</strong>, he must defeat the monsters that dwell within the world inside the paintings and solve the puzzles scattered throughout each area to progress.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/40c25aa20da991768fc65fab1486a996.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[World]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the late Joseon era, Western paintings became popular across the land. However, the creatures sealed inside these paintings began to awaken and attack nearby villages. Behind this chaos was <strong>Yuyahheukgun</strong>, a sorcerer from Qing China who sought to plunge Joseon into disorder and rule it by using the power of Western art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop him and protect the people, <strong>Jeon Woo-chi</strong>, the greatest Taoist sorcerer of Joseon, set out on his journey. But after being defeated by Yuyahheukgun’s overwhelming magic, he becomes trapped inside the world of the paintings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Taoist Arts]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/b7bffb808fe6fd3498e936f2723b51ad.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeon Woo-chi uses various Taoist abilities—illusion magic, clone techniques, and instant-step movement—to defeat his enemies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illusion:</strong> Casts an illusion on enemies, causing them to fight each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Clone Technique:</strong> Summons a clone identical to Jeon Woo-chi to assist in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Step:</strong> Dodges an enemy’s attack and instantly appears in front of them to strike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Action]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/1dd35d5e864c52b7d6f6812dec4548f4.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>parries</strong> and <strong>perfect dodges</strong> to defeat your foes and enjoy stylish execution moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[2D]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.poster.avif?t=1764779713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.webm?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137640/extras/54210ec9175311ab99c881bd257fcee0.mp4?t=1764779713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During combat, Jeon Woo-chi can enter the world inside the painting and engage in <strong>2D side-scrolling combat</strong>. Seamlessly switch between <strong>2D and 3D</strong> for a unique and dynamic combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Content]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jeon Woo-chi explores a <strong>total of four maps</strong>, he must defeat the monsters that dwell within the world inside the paintings and solve the puzzles scattered throughout each area to progress.</p>",
